            -75.241005,43.09724,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Bourry Box</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6xbCJhPYQ-GiqA0lIGzxbcjh7DGe2V-uqBQlDWXMgfWn4xzDf3GwSzmGFdBbARPiXzk8q9YtNqp8DyYfn589eVUCyJBxPDdhy6H09PzpB7f85J3aCFQ7-8k9YCJ2EDqX2coF-W7w" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Bourry box car kiln, cross draft design with primary air preheater and built in pizza oven.  60 cu. ft.  Built 2009.David Voorhees2212 Green River Rd.Zirconia, NC 28790828-698-8775www.davidvoorheespottery.comvoorheespottery@gmail.com]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-503-DB4436</styleUrl>
