        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Finch Down Draft</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6GCcUiNNo6-yxfzJUHX4WuMId4UZNb01wThYkblkgZsfgkiLL8NRudsf0EoGxpR-2qbipAsgcZT6KIQlgxiBy9PjvfYqPhM2QeLwTM9UoCORpzdfxZzYlzqnKYsTxKNp1efw" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Own design. Opposing fireboxes under chamber, central flue.  1.5 cubic meters packing area. <br>Additional wood-fired &#39;soda&#39; kiln.<br><br><br>Contact: Joe Finch<br> Tanygroes, Cardigan,<br><br>SA43 2HR Wales, UK<br><br>Size of kiln: <br><br>Contact name: Joe Finch<br><br>joe@joefinch.co.uk (mailto:joe@joefinch.co.uk)<br>www.joefinchkilns.co.uk (http://www.joefinchkilns.co.uk) &amp; www.potteryandpaintings.co.uk (http://www.potteryandpaintings.co.uk)]]></description>
